{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_29", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": 98, "width": 700, "height": 250, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_30", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 114, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - SIZE IT FROM YOUR LIST", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - SIZE IT FROM YOUR LIST", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_31", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 149, "width": 656, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The list size and how fast you want the invites out decide the domain and mailbox count. 30\na day per mailbox, 3 mailboxes per domain, so 10 to 20 domains is 30 to 60 mailboxes and 900\nto 1,800 invites a day once warm.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "The list size and how fast you want the invites out decide the domain and mailbox count. 30\na day per mailbox, 3 mailboxes per domain, so 10 to 20 domains is 30 to 60 mailboxes and 900\nto 1,800 invites a day once warm.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_32", "type": "rectangle", "x": 796, "y": 86, "width": 1048, "height": 362, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1811180650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 168393880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_33", "type": "text", "x": 818, "y": 102, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - CLEAN THE OLD LIST FIRST", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - CLEAN THE OLD LIST FIRST", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_34", "type": "text", "x": 818, "y": 138, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "An old list is the fastest way to burn 20 new domains. Every address is verified before it is loaded, bounces and catch-alls are split out,\nand the clean list is what goes in.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "An old list is the fastest way to burn 20 new domains. Every address is verified before it is loaded, bounces and catch-alls are split out,\nand the clean list is what goes in.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_35", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2022, "y": -66, "width": 1068, "height": 362, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_36", "type": "text", "x": 2044, "y": -50, "width": 1024, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - DOMAINS AND MAILBOXES, NEVER YOUR MAIN DOMAIN", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - DOMAINS AND MAILBOXES, NEVER YOUR MAIN DOMAIN", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_37", "type": "text", "x": 2044, "y": -14, "width": 1024, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1159380354, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2036236842, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Lookalike sending domains and their mailboxes are provisioned together through a mailbox provider on your account and your card, about $3 to\n$4 per mailbox a month. Pre-warmed mailboxes if the webinar date is close.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Lookalike sending domains and their mailboxes are provisioned together through a mailbox provider on your account and your card, about $3 to\n$4 per mailbox a month. Pre-warmed mailboxes if the webinar date is close.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_38", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3290, "y": -90, "width": 1048, "height": 326, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 279172787, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260573196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_39", "type": "text", "x": 3312, "y": -74, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1329753548, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1914012529, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - AUTHENTICATION THAT KEEPS YOU OUT OF SPAM", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - AUTHENTICATION THAT KEEPS YOU OUT OF SPAM", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_40", "type": "text", "x": 3312, "y": -38, "width": 1004, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1222328496, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1656961616, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "SPF, DKIM, DMARC, MX and a custom tracking domain on every sending domain, verified before a single invite goes out.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "SPF, DKIM, DMARC, MX and a custom tracking domain on every sending domain, verified before a single invite goes out.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_41", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4536, "y": 74, "width": 1048, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1490376254, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 96907016, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_42", "type": "text", "x": 4558, "y": 90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1982966163, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1526706730, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - INSTANTLY IN YOUR NAME, THEN YOUR LOGIN", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - INSTANTLY IN YOUR NAME, THEN YOUR LOGIN", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_43", "type": "text", "x": 4558, "y": 126, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 721762279, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 502922617, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Every mailbox imported into an Instantly workspace you own, warmup running, limits ramped, one unibox for replies. You get the login, paste\nthe list and the sequence, and press send.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Every mailbox imported into an Instantly workspace you own, warmup running, limits ramped, one unibox for replies. You get the login, paste\nthe list and the sequence, and press send.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 228, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_44"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 251.25, "width": 256, "height": 38, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "te